                    </A>
                  </H5>
                </DIV>
                <DIV id="collapse-1"  ARIA-LABELLEDBY="heading-1">
                  <DIV class="card-body head-body">
                  <h6>Scanned Documents (Upto 1 MB) required for online application are:</h5>
         
         
            1. Passport Size Photo<BR>
            2. Highest Educational Qualification<BR>
            3. Project Report Summary/ Detailed Project Report<BR>
            4. Social/ Special Category Certificate, if applicable<BR>
            5. Rural area certificate if applicable <BR>
         
         
                  </DIV>
                </DIV>
              </DIV>
                
                
                
                 <DIV class="card">
                <DIV class="card-header" id="heading-1">
                  <H5 class="mb-0">
                    <A style="background-color:#993333; color:#FFFFFF;">
                     Steps
                    </A>
                  </H5>
                </DIV>
                <DIV id="collapse-1"  ARIA-LABELLEDBY="heading-1">
                  <DIV class="card-body head-body">
                       <H6>Steps for Online Application</H6>
1. Check your eligibility<BR>
2. Validate/ Authenticate Aadhaar details online<BR>
3. Generation of User ID and Password that shall be sent through SMS to the registered mobile number of the applicant.<BR>
4. Login to PMEGP portal to fill further details<BR>
5. Upload the required documents<BR>
6. Fill up the Score Card and verify details<BR>
7. Final Submission<BR>
Applicant can track the status of application form submission till final disbursement and adjustment of MM subsidy.
          
                  </DIV>
